-- AC: 3 of 3 task Acceptance Criteria rows are driven. The sub-matrices are 5 of 5 `Authorize` entries, 3 of 3 wrapper outcomes (attach/takeover/noninteractive park), 5 of 5 moved remote-lapsed grid classes plus 3 of 3 neighbouring vectors, 1 of 1 arm-order mutant, and 4 of 4 importer packages in the per-test diff. Named call sites and bounds are in `internal/fencing/TRACEABILITY.md`, `internal/terminstance/TRACEABILITY.md`, and the task-scoped results.
